<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, user-scalable=no">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#211a3b">
  <title>마요 러너</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="./src/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <main class="app">
    <header class="topbar">
      <div class="brand">
        <span class="seed">✦</span>
        <div>
          <strong>마요 러너</strong>
          <small>HAESSI STAR RUN</small>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stats">
        <div><small>점수</small><b id="score">000000</b></div>
        <div><small>최고 기록</small><b id="best">000000</b></div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="game-wrap">
      <canvas id="game" width="360" height="640"></canvas>

      <div id="overlay" class="overlay">
        <div class="title-mark">🐹</div>
        <p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE RUNNER</p>
        <h1 id="overlay-title">마요 러너</h1>
        <p id="overlay-copy">해씨를 모으고 장애물을 피해 달려봐!</p>
        <button id="start">스타트!</button>
        <small class="help">
          ← → 레인 이동 · ↑ 점프 · ↓ 슬라이딩<br>
          모바일은 스와이프 또는 아래 버튼
        </small>
      </div>

      <div class="hud-row">
        <span id="seed-count">🌻 0</span>
        <span id="distance">0 m</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <nav class="mobile-controls">
      <button data-action="left">◀</button>
      <button data-action="jump">▲</button>
      <button data-action="slide">▼</button>
      <button data-action="right">▶</button>
    </nav>

    <p class="footer-note">해씨별의 노을길을 달리는 작은 마요</p>
  </main>
  <script src="./src/game.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
